                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Proves a wire is dead?</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">No</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">A useful first check, not final proof</td>
                  </tr>
